WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.147 --> 00:00:05.280
This season grab 'em by the tinsel with the&nbsp;
official White House 2020 Christmas Ornament.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.545
The largest, classiest, most beautiful ornament ever&nbsp;created.

00:00:08.545 --> 00:00:12.075
And it comes with a synthetic epoxy so it really sticks to that tree.

00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:18.131
Don't worry you can get it loose, it just takes a while and damages the tree in the process.

00:00:18.131 --> 00:00:21.418
While you're at it,&nbsp;why not pick up some ornaments from previous&nbsp;administrations?

00:00:21.418 --> 00:00:24.903
Like this delightful Obama&nbsp;Ornament, the most transparent in history.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.903 --> 00:00:27.657
We've got plenty of administration ornaments to&nbsp;choose from.

00:00:27.657 --> 00:00:31.376
 Buy two and we'll send you a Thomas Jefferson Ancestry.com gift card.

00:00:31.376 --> 00:00:35.242
Buy five and you'll receive a festive Waco Compound yule log.  

00:00:35.242 --> 00:00:38.594
Did you know we require other government&nbsp;agencies to make ornaments?

00:00:38.594 --> 00:00:40.126
How else would ornaments get made? 

00:00:40.126 --> 00:00:46.543
Get the latest fabulous designs from the NSA, the TSA, the IRS, the Department of Education,

00:00:46.543 --> 00:00:48.765
even the New York Department of Corrections. 

00:00:48.765 --> 00:00:52.290
This year the ornament&nbsp;absolutely unquestionably hangs itself.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:56.784
Congress&nbsp;can't agree on a new one so they've been issuing&nbsp;the same continuing ordinance since 1997.

00:00:56.784 --> 00:01:00.928
And while&nbsp;the Small Business Administration is restricted&nbsp;from selling ornaments this year due to COVID,

00:01:00.928 --> 00:01:05.117
the FDA ornament should be coming soon, we're just waiting on the approval process. 

00:01:05.117 --> 00:01:08.187
Might have&nbsp;it by January, but who knows.

00:01:08.187 --> 00:01:08.829
No rush. 

00:01:08.829 --> 00:01:14.000
Not...not a big deal, take your time. Take your time.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.439
And speaking of January don't forget to tune in for the Federal Government's New Year's Eve Spectacular

00:01:18.439 --> 00:01:20.793
where&nbsp;once again the CDC will be dropping the ball.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.793 --> 00:01:24.283
Merry Christmas and happy holidays from the White&nbsp;House Commemorative Ornament,

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:27.678
and Fuel Efficiency Standards Commission, a federal sub agency

00:01:27.678 --> 00:01:31.509
jointly governed by the White House Visitors Center and the U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service,

00:01:31.509 --> 00:01:34.129
in&nbsp;conjunction with the Federal Pension Guarantee&nbsp;Committee 

00:01:34.129 --> 00:01:39.840
White House Christmas Ornaments,&nbsp;
because everything needs to be political.

